					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>微风拂过你的脸颊，留下了一封泛黄的信纸</span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▶————————————————————————————————————————————————————◀</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▶————————————————————————————————————————————————————◀</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><br /> <em>吾即是风</em><br /> <em>挥浓墨于笑谈中</em></p> </div> <br /> <br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>微风，安于内乱-原创主要文档合集</span></h2> <hr /> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1135">SCP-CN-1135 呆滞转座子</a></span></h3> <p><em>又回到那个孤单压抑的房间，不明无亮。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1273">SCP-CN-1273 欲倒载干戈，而你可安好？</a></span></h3> <p><em>这生日，我下去给你过。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1278">SCP-CN-1278 轮</a></span></h3> <p><em>Ты отправишься в рай（你将去往天堂）</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1323">SCP-CN-1323 粉红佳人</a></span></h3> <p><em>我本就是天仙，何人有异议？</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1328">SCP-CN-1328 医者仁心</a></span></h3> <p><em>救济苍生的地方为何要充满压迫与剥削&#8230;&#8230;</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1439">SCP-CN-1439 戏班</a></span></h3> <p><em>人民战士被埋没在人们回忆的长河中。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1562">SCP-CN-1562 一生二，二生三</a></span></h3> <p><em>涡虫风暴，血染长江。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1854">SCP-CN-1854 绝唱</a></span></h3> <p><em>亿万年的底蕴，终敌不过贪婪的众生。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h2><span>清风，徐徐落笔-原创故事合集</span></h2> <hr /> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/storyofyou">下一次尝试</a></span></h3> <p><em>愿每个创世神都能让他的造物发光。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/phone-call-reality">主控服务中心通话记录#17382</a></span></h3> <p><em>对于Site-CN-429的一切，我们无能为力。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/dreamofyou">吾所深爱的梦</a></span></h3> <p><em>我的怀中，空无一物，却满满当当。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h2><span>诡风，刺骨寒心-原创Creepy Pasta合集</span></h2> <hr /> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-tree">吾母老槐</a></span></h3> <p><em>妈妈的职责已尽，是时候由孩子们来反哺了。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h2><span>西风，融汇沟通-翻译主要文档合集</span></h2> <hr /> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2163">SCP-2163 好莱坞</a></span></h3> <p><em>那些五光十色只是骗局。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2764">SCP-2764 南极异兽</a></span></h3> <p><em>我只希望这次不再是我了。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3681">SCP-3681 5 - 0</a></span></h3> <p><em>那只球队？他们已经实现了他们的目标。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5380">SCP-5380 吾的世界</a></span></h3> <p><em>我让你来到了我的世界，随后……你就成为了我的世界。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h2><span>喜风，笑口常开-翻译搞笑文档合集</span></h2> <hr /> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-99826-j">SCP-99826-J 心灵螺丝</a></span></h3> <p><em>（低声喃喃）我知道你在那里。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h2><span>谐风，与君共勉-合著/参与/建议文档合集</span></h2> <hr /> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1518">SCP-CN-1518 忆唐终曲</a></span></h3> <p><em>作者：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608734079" alt="Confucian Lee" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" >Confucian Lee</a></span></em><br /> <em>且听，这是来自大唐的末曲。</em><br /> <br /></p> <h2><span>狂风，啸纸喷墨-艺术作品合集</span></h2> <hr /> <h3><span><a target="_blank" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/happystormzhangart">至狂风呼啸处 风的艺作</a></span></h3> <p><br /> <br /> <br /></p> <p>▶————————————————————————————————————————————————————◀<br /></p> </div> <br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/h-storm-z" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4761754&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608734079" alt="H-Storm Z" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4761754)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/h-storm-z" >H-Storm Z</a></span>：请将你的一切倾诉写在信纸中，风会聆听。<br /> <br /> 在恭喜风风喜提人事页的同时，我开始思考为什么自己到现在还没有人事页，难道是我不会写小短篇的原因？——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6331978&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608734079" alt="carter lu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6331978)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/carter-lu" >carter lu</a></span><br /> <br /> 你鸽了一年来着吧&#8230;——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/artcgb" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4847732&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608734079" alt="ARtcgb" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4847732)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/artcgb" >ARtcgb</a></span><br /> <br /> 恭喜风风喜提人事！我的还遥遥无期……（哭）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608734079" alt="Confucian Lee" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" >Confucian Lee</a></span><br /> <br /> ▶————————————————————————————————————————————————————◀ <h2><span>你迎风放飞了信纸，希望下一个幸运儿能找到</span></h2> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe frameborder="no" border="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" width="330" height="86" src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com//music.163.com/outchain/player?type=2&id=586299&auto=1&height=66"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>自查用</span></h2> </div> <div class="infobox"></div> <div class="sortbar {$sortbar}"></div> <div class="translation {$translation}"></div> <div class="collab-header" style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h2><span>更多页面</span></h2> <hr /></div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>成就墙</span></h2> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%A1%A8%E6%98%8E.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%A1%A8%E6%98%8E.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>加入证明</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>被批准加入网站</strong></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%AF%E3%81%98%E3%82%81%E3%81%BE%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%81%AE%E6%8C%A8%E6%8B%B6.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%AF%E3%81%98%E3%82%81%E3%81%BE%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%81%AE%E6%8C%A8%E6%8B%B6.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>初次见面</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在讨论区发言</strong></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%9F%E9%A8%93%E5%AE%A4.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%A7%98%E5%AF%86%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%9F%E9%A8%93%E5%AE%A4.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>秘密实验室</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在沙盒中创建自己的页面</strong></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%84%E3%82%8C%E3%81%B0.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E4%B8%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%84%E3%82%8C%E3%81%B0.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>三人行</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在讨论区发布草稿</strong></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B0%8F%E3%81%95%E3%81%AA%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A9.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B0%8F%E3%81%95%E3%81%AA%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A9.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>一小步</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇文档</strong> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-CN-1343(旧)</span></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%8E%A1%E7%94%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E6%8E%A1%E7%94%A8%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>录取通知</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>创建人事档案</strong></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%85%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%85%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>铜奖章</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分15以上的文档</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1439">SCP-CN-1439</a></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%80%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%8A%80%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>银奖章</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分30以上的文档</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1323">SCP-CN-1323</a></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%87%91%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%87%91%E3%83%A1%E3%83%80%E3%83%AB.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>金奖章</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分50以上的文档</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1562">SCP-CN-1562</a></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%BF%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E3%81%84%E3%83%BB%E3%81%9D%E3%81%86%E3%81%95%E3%81%8F.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%BF%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E3%81%84%E3%83%BB%E3%81%9D%E3%8