wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3461191&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608734084" alt="indonootoko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3461191)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" >indonootoko</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>长了胳膊和腿的鲑鱼？呃……<br /> 总觉得还有些东西没弄明白。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-172-jp">SCP-172-JP</a></td> <td>動作確認モデル</td> <td>动作确认模型</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ak1-yorunaga" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1745066&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608734084" alt="ak1-yorunaga" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1745066)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ak1-yorunaga" >ak1-yorunaga</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>看起来是企划人员用的东西。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-324-jp">SCP-324-JP</a></td> <td>私はあなただけを見つめる</td> <td>我只注视着你</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kazz4423" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2082870&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608734084" alt="kazz4423" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2082870)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kazz4423" >kazz4423</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>那个人，生前到底遭遇了什么……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1728-jp-ex">SCP-1728-JP-EX</a></td> <td>う</td> <td>う</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/inemurik" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2919938&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608734084" alt="inemurik" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.